flowers.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הראיתי להם את התמונות.","en":"I showed them the pictures.","alt":["I showed them the photos."],"t":"l"},{"he":"ראיתיו בקפה עם חברים.","en":"I saw him at the cafe with friends.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"נתתיה לילדים.","en":"I gave it to the children.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אמרתי לו שאני עייף.","en":"I told him I'm tired.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"שלחתי לה מכתב ארוך.","en":"I sent her a long letter.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הראיתי להם איך לעשות את זה.","en":"I showed them how to do it.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ראיתיו אבל הוא לא ראה אותי.","en":"I saw him but he didn't see me.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"נתתיה בחזרה.","en":"I gave it back.","alt":["I returned it."],"t":"t"},{"he":"שמעתיך שר במקלחת!","en":"I heard you singing in the shower!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אמרתי לו את האמת.","en":"I told him the truth.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"שלחתי לה את הכתובת.","en":"I sent her the address.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הראיתי להם את הדרך.","en":"I showed them the way.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ראיתיו כמה פעמים.","en":"I saw him a few times.","alt":["I saw him several times."],"t":"l"},{"he":"נתתיה לאמא שלי.","en":"I gave it to my mom.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אמרתי לו לחכות.","en":"I told him to wait.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שלחתי לה הזמנה.","en":"I sent her an invitation.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הראיתי להם את המסמך.","en":"I showed them the document.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ראיתיו עובד בגן.","en":"I saw him working in the garden.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שמעתיך צוחק בלילה.","en":"I heard you laughing at night.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אמרתי לו שאני אוהב אותו.","en":"I told him I love him.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"שלחתי לה מייל אתמול.","en":"I sent her an email yesterday.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הראיתי להם היכן המסעדה.","en":"I showed them where the restaurant is.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"ראיתיו וחייכתי.","en":"I saw him and smiled.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"נתתיה כמתנה.","en":"I gave it as a gift.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אמרתי לו שלום וברחתי.","en":"I told him hello and ran away.","alt":[],"t":"l"}],"hints":{"אבל":"but","אוהב":"love / loves","אותו":"him","אותי":"me","איך":"how","אמרתי":"I said / I told","את":"(accusative marker)","אתמול":"yesterday","בגן":"in the garden","בחדר":"in the room","בחזרה":"back / in return","בלילה":"at night","במקלחת":"in the shower","בקפה":"at the cafe","ברחוב":"in the street","בשוק":"at the market","האמת":"the truth","הבית":"the house","הדרך":"the way / the road","הודעה":"message","הוא":"he","הולדת":"birth (birthday)","הזמנה":"invitation","היכן":"where","הכתובת":"the address","המסמך":"the document","המסעדה":"the restaurant","הראיתי":"I showed","התמונות":"the pictures / the photos","וברחתי":"and I ran away","וחייכתי":"and I smiled","זה":"this / it","חברים":"friends","כמה":"a few / some","כמתנה":"as a gift","לבוא":"to come","לה":"to her / her","להם":"to them","לו":"to him / him","לחברה":"to the friend (feminine)","לחכות":"to wait","לילדים":"to the children","ליום":"for the day","למורה":"to the teacher","לעשות":"to do / to make","לא":"no / not","לאמא":"to mom","מגיע":"coming / arriving","מדבר":"talking / speaking","מייל":"email","מכתב":"letter","מתנה":"present / gift","נתתיה":"I gave it / I gave her","עובד":"working / works","עליי":"about me","עם":"with","עייף":"tired","פעמים":"times","פרחים":"flowers","צוחק":"laughing","ראה":"saw","ראיתיו":"I saw him","רץ":"running / runs","שאני":"that I","שלום":"hello / peace","שלי":"my / mine","שלחתי":"I sent","שמעתיך":"I heard you","שר":"singing / sang","תודה":"thank you / thanks","ארוך":"long"},"words":[{"he":"ראיתיו","en":"I saw him","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"re'itiv"},{"he":"נתתיה","en":"I gave it/her","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"netatihah"},{"he":"שמעתיך","en":"I heard you","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"shama'tikha"},{"he":"אמרתי לו","en":"I told him","alt":["I said to him"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"amarti lo"},{"he":"שלחתי לה","en":"I sent her","alt":["I sent to her"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"shlakhti lah"},{"he":"הראיתי להם","en":"I showed them","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"her'eiti lahem"},{"he":"אמרתי","en":"I said","alt":["I told"],"from":"skill","tr":"amarti"},{"he":"שלחתי","en":"I sent","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"shlakhti"},{"he":"הראיתי","en":"I showed","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"her'eiti"},{"he":"ראה","en":"saw","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ra'ah"},{"he":"פרחים","en":"flowers","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"prakhim"},{"he":"מכתב","en":"letter","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mikhtav"},{"he":"כתובת","en":"address","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ktovet"},{"he":"מסמך","en":"document","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"mismakh"},{"he":"מתנה","en":"present","alt":["gift"],"from":"phrase","tr":"matanah"},{"he":"חברה","en":"friend (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"khaverah"},{"he":"יום הולדת","en":"birthday","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"yom huledet"},{"he":"מקלחת","en":"shower","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"miklakhat"}],"lexemes":["ראיתיו","נתתיה","שמעתיך","אמרתי","שלחתי","הראיתי","פרחים","מכתב","כתובת","מסמך","וחייכתי","וברחתי","צוחק","מקלחת","הזמנה","מייל"],"tips":"## Object Pronoun Suffixes on Verbs\n\nIn formal and literary Hebrew, object pronouns can attach directly to the verb:\n\n| Suffix | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| -ו (iv/av) | him / it (m) | ראית**יו** -- I saw **him** |\n| -ה (ah/ha) | her / it (f) | נתת**יה** -- I gave **her/it** |\n| -ך (kha) | you (m.s.) | שמעת**יך** -- I heard **you** |\n| -ם (am) | them (m) | שלחת**ים** -- I sent **them** |\n\n### Suffixed vs. Analytical Forms\nBoth forms mean the same thing:\n- ראיתיו = ראיתי אותו (I saw him)\n- נתתיה = נתתי אותה (I gave her/it)\n- שמעתיך = שמעתי אותך (I heard you)\n\n### Analytical Forms (More Common in Speech)\nIn everyday Hebrew, the separate pronoun is more common:\n- **אמרתי לו** (I told him) -- using ל + pronoun\n- **שלחתי לה** (I sent her)\n- **הראיתי להם** (I showed them)\n\nThe suffix forms are found in literature, news, prayers, and formal writing. Recognizing them is essential for reading Hebrew texts beyond casual conversation."}